er","hash_xxh64":"0x5D10213A8297494F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"おお！やっと連絡してくれたか。<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>よ、そっちはどうだ？","female":"おお！やっと連絡してくれたか。<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>よ、そっちはどうだ？","variant_male_record_index":"156512","variant_female_record_index":"156513","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410253004:3":{"text":"とにかく、そのドワーフさんに地上まで連れて行ってもらうのを待ってるんです。","source_cn":"总之，我们现在意外掉到了地底，正在等那个矮人带我们回去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBB0A3B0920599A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1410253005:0":{"text":"そうだったのか。だから村人たちが慌てているのだな。きっと騒ぎに気づいたのだろう……","source_cn":"原来是这样。怪不得外头矮人们慌成一团，多半是发现了乱子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C9AB2403AAAEA50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1410253006:0":{"text":"マスターがいなくなったことに、村長さんたちが気づいたのですか？","source_cn":"弗林他们察觉到主人不见了吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6E1024C6EE18CD25","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"マスターがいなくなったことに、村長さんたちが気づいたのですか？","female":"マスターがいなくなったことに、村長さんたちが気づいたのですか？","variant_male_record_index":"156516","variant_female_record_index":"156517","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1410253007:0":{"text":"ああ、ひとまず具合が悪いと言ってその場を切り抜けたが……","source_cn":"嗯，但我说梅林水土不服，糊弄过去了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6B4F38C46D0F312A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ああ、ひとまず具合が悪いと言ってその場を切り抜けたが……","female":"ああ、ひとまず具合が悪